  unitName: Colossal Spirit Jireid
  unitId: 40937
  unitNumber: 1644
  description: Had his creator sought to continue his improvements upon Jireid until
    the very end, no one would have been able to surpass his conception's power in
    all of Grand Gaia. Therefore, it is a fortuitous thing that the corpse deteriorated
    as it did. However, since the dark research that Jireid's creator had carried
    out came to be feared by the gods of Grand Gaia themselves, they came to see
    him as a threat. Some speculate that this is the reason behind their eventual
    desire for humankind's destruction.
  summonDesc: My creator granted me the soul of a demon, and the power of a beast...<br>I
    am the most powerful being in existence!
  fusionDesc: Argh...<br>I can feel my power rising...<br>But unlike other experiments,<br>this
    I can handle...
  evoDesc: It doesn't matter what I am.<br>The fact that I'm the strongest gives
    meaning to my very existence.
  element: 4
  rarity: 7
